<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:25Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>白紙運動四年之後，上海青年公共空間去哪兒了？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe851kg1kj1o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:14Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T00:29:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe851kg1kj1o/trad--7ba6a5acc106.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe851kg1kj1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白紙運動四年後，BBC中文對話多位上海酒吧、咖啡店老闆和昔日常客、白紙運動親歷者，在他們眼裡，青年空間是如何在四年裡逐漸消失的。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普深圳會晤一週後再揮關稅大棒 對華稅率可達40%</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9ly484v6pdzo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:16Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T08:34:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9ly484v6pdzo/trad--fb116966281e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9ly484v6pdzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白宮稱，新關稅針對的是貿易夥伴的「結構性產能過剩」。經濟學家則警告，關稅由進口商品的美國企業支付，成本若轉嫁給消費者，可能推高物價並抑制全球貿易。</summary></entry><entry><title>宏福苑大火一周年：居民受壓、媒體噤聲，為何悼念變得小心翼翼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw8dv46pv125o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T05:41:40Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw8dv46pv125o/trad--ac8676f9bc2a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw8dv46pv125o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">宏福苑大火一周年前夕，港府官員稱「政府絕對容許」合法活動，但有遺屬表示悼念活動受壓，也有新聞工作者向BBC中文透露，相關周年報導在製作完成後突然「被抽起」。</summary></entry><entry><title>宏福苑大火一週年：「這條刺永遠都在」，遺屬在傷痛中尋找答案</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j4r274lj82o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T03:21:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j4r274lj82o/trad--907a7a594dc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j4r274lj82o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">對許多家庭來說，道歉只是「最低消費」，他們仍在等一個完整的答案。BBC中文接觸了多位遇難者家屬，記錄他們怎樣度過這一年。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國法院裁定：中國科技巨頭華為，共謀竊取商業機密罪名成立</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq8lz8ddyg9o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T07:35:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq8lz8ddyg9o/trad--7a623113ad1c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq8lz8ddyg9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">華為在美被判10項罪成，包括竊取商業機密與銀行欺詐，但敲詐勒索組織罪無罪。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣「九合一」選舉：六都市長候選人簡介</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwlymzm5mnxyo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:22Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T04:29:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwlymzm5mnxyo/trad--b8c48542c832.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwlymzm5mnxyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這場選舉將影響藍綠政治版圖，六都選情備受關注，包括台北、新北、桃園、台中、台南、高雄，BBC中文整理各地候選人的簡介。</summary></entry><entry><title>高雄選戰「知識藍」對決「新潮流」，國民黨能複製「韓流」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T16:25:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad--a43863954373.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6n4ex4y9837o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">柯志恩以「知識藍」的姿態拉攏中間選民，支持度大幅追貼深耕高雄20年的賴瑞隆，選情咬緊。</summary></entry><entry><title>「藍白合」示範區：新竹市選情如何透露台灣第三勢力的未來？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cme3d27d7lnpo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T09:49:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cme3d27d7lnpo/trad--f5d08918cba0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cme3d27d7lnpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">新竹市是民眾黨此前唯一贏得執政權的縣市，現任市長高虹安尋求連任，她這次雖已退出民眾黨、改以無黨籍身分參選，但學者指出其選情不僅將影響雙方未來合作模式能否延續，也可能牽動2028年全國大選的政治布局。</summary></entry><entry><title>「九合一」五大看點：「洋流」能否撼動台北？誰在卡位2028？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T02:45:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad--4fc64a9bc6d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8xzrg40dq1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中共是否介入台灣選舉？ 這次選舉將如何影響賴清德與國民黨主席鄭麗文的政治能量？捲土重來、希望藉著地方議員選舉有所斬獲的小黨，此次結盟能否在主流政黨夾殺中突圍而出？</summary></entry><entry><title>英國將性犯罪定罪難民送往史瓦帝尼　未公開協議內容</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr868g89jdw0o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:39:25Z</updated><published>2026-11-26T04:58:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr868g89jdw0o/trad--5285ac06978c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr868g89jdw0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這被認為是目前已知首起英國政府將難民永久強制重新安置到海外的案例。</summary></entry><entry><title>BBC事實查核：與中國有關帳號用AI生成影攻擊台灣選舉候選人</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmgvkp322xo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T11:53:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmgvkp322xo/trad--b840e2d70ae2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6rmgvkp322xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一波與中國有關的帳號用AI生成影片，攻擊台灣執政黨關鍵人物，包括總統賴清德和台北市長候選人沈伯洋。</summary></entry><entry><title>陳吉寧：「清華系」失勢、「上海跳板」失靈與政治局委員落馬</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck7v27vn9659o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T14:54:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck7v27vn9659o/trad--83e451da2e3d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck7v27vn9659o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">陳吉寧落馬的時點尤其敏感：距離二十一大換屆不到一年，他本是外界觀察下屆常委佈局的關鍵人物，被查前僅僅六天仍在公開調研。</summary></entry><entry><title>伊朗女歌手演出不戴頭巾「已遭執行74鞭笞刑」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxzd9y2gre3lo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T02:19:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxzd9y2gre3lo/trad--ae54b3386400.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxzd9y2gre3lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">據律師團隊所稱，伊朗女歌手帕拉斯托·阿赫瑪迪、三名音樂人及一名製作人在庫姆被執行74鞭笞刑。</summary></entry><entry><title>神舟二十四號成功發射 首位巴基斯坦航天員登中國「天宮」意味什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9w91y0pge7o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T09:44:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9w91y0pge7o/trad--4ea679b02792.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9w91y0pge7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這次任務對航天員阿里而言，這是巴基斯坦的榮耀時刻；對中國而言，則是其與美國爭奪太空主導地位競賽中的又一步進展。</summary></entry><entry><title>「不能沒有你」：黃仁勳回歸，台灣股市的狂歡與半導體「 黑天鵝」風險</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crp3eqg9l8eeo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T14:35:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crp3eqg9l8eeo/trad--aaca6ec591ec.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crp3eqg9l8eeo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳在美國總統特朗普介入下重掌輝達，台灣股民在台股漲停板的氣氛大喊「爸爸回來了」。但「台灣乾爹」會再一次變成黑天鵝嗎？</summary></entry><entry><title>我們如何知道疫苗安全？它們是如何經過測試？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6qj5772kl0go/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T00:27:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6qj5772kl0go/trad--4d4ebe5a2954.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6qj5772kl0go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從實驗室試驗到終身的安全監測，疫苗在提供給民眾前後，都會經過多重檢驗。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何黃仁勳大到不能被解僱？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6qx5eqgg0rwo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T19:19:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6qx5eqgg0rwo/trad--86f72afc5693.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6qx5eqgg0rwo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">英偉達能夠發展成為人工智能產業的核心支柱，黃仁勳在當中發揮的關鍵作用，最終成為決定性因素。</summary></entry><entry><title>上海市委書記陳吉寧被查 中共高層明日之星意外隕落</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c83vgd1l5erlo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-25T11:14:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c83vgd1l5erlo/trad--d2b2e6812ce5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c83vgd1l5erlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國宣佈上海市委書記陳吉寧因「涉嫌嚴重違紀違法」，正接受當局的調查。這名此前仕途光明的官員原本有望進入政治局常委會，甚至可能成為總理接班人。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港宏福苑大火一週年：災後餘生，家在何方？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvg261dkxp7o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T23:49:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvg261dkxp7o/trad--319ba3ca1ae2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqvg261dkxp7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港宏福苑大火一周年，BBC中文紀錄多位難屬如何走過災後一年。這場香港數十年以最致命災難奪去168條性命，1984戶失去家園，包括喪失丈夫與爸爸的Christy一家與父母雙亡的蘇先生。一年來，災民一邊重建新生活，一邊等待調查報告、申請法律援助，一邊向年幼孩子解釋死亡。調查結論公布後，官員辭職，數十人被捕或起訴。但對許多仍在傷痛中家庭來說，一切遠遠未及完結。</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳回歸輝達 特朗普稱曾出手斡旋</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj5y1xdgv0x7o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-24T09:56:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj5y1xdgv0x7o/trad--64898396e705.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cj5y1xdgv0x7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">輝達（Nvidia）共同創辦人黃仁勳辭職僅11天後突然重返公司，帶動輝達股價大幅反彈。董事會此前曾表明無意讓他復職。然而特朗普聲稱曾親自出面斡旋，促成黃仁勳本次回歸。這場復職風波也凸顯了科技巨頭與政治權力之間的複雜關係。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣「九合一」選舉：有哪些看點？藍綠勝負如何影響2028大選佈局？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3vyl0x1x6o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T15:55:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3vyl0x1x6o/trad--d8ec69c28835.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3vyl0x1x6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">11月28日，台灣將舉行「九合一」地方選舉。BBC中文走訪台北、新北與高雄三大關鍵戰場，解析藍綠激戰、中間選民崛起，以及中國因素對選情的影響。這場選舉不只關乎地方治理，也可能為2028年總統大選定下基調。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄「三巨頭」會晤的台前幕後</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn0d4pnrj31o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T16:16:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn0d4pnrj31o/trad--4b4d8f07ee39.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn0d4pnrj31o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC記者從深圳帶你回顧這場中美俄「三巨頭」峰會的台前幕後。</summary></entry><entry><title>APEC上與習近平、特朗普歷史性會晤，對普京是一場重大勝利</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq702kdw845ro/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-22T03:46:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq702kdw845ro/trad--12120a5a45a8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq702kdw845ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">週四美國、中國和俄羅斯領導人的會晤將為普京（普丁）提供一個重要的舞台——但這並不會讓他離贏得烏克蘭戰爭更近一步。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄「三巨頭」坐在了一起，世界正滑向大國共管嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvglr9r243x6o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T00:11:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvglr9r243x6o/trad--34ff6da99463.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cvglr9r243x6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「他們能坐下來，就說明這個世界還沒有到第一次或第二次世界大戰那個狀況。」香港科技大學榮休教授丁學良對BBC說。</summary></entry><entry><title>中美能源大戰如何影響你的帳單？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T01:45:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad--bf8b484b78f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmvg2er51z1wo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中美之間的博弈可能會對能源成本產生重大影響，但誰會最終獲勝？</summary></entry><entry><title>黃仁勳曾告訴我，那些關於中國與國家安全的問題</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T02:41:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad--d34e970c53e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm36gnenlj59o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳正因涉嫌與一名中國間諜出軌而接受調查，他對世界秩序的未來遠比其他科技巨頭老闆重要得多。</summary></entry><entry><title>DeepSeek被美國政府系統禁用：中美AI競爭繼續升溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:42:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad--c79590262ebf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">DeepSeek的免費聊天機器人應用程式在Apple App Store下載排行榜上名列前茅，其AI模型也被美國科技企業採用。Snowflake、Vercel及OpenRouter等公司都已將DeepSeek整合至其提供給客戶的服務中。</summary></entry><entry><title>Anthropic公司或許已解決重大數學難題：黎曼猜想</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe85gr487dno/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T00:10:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe85gr487dno/trad--5f715a8024f2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwe85gr487dno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Anthropic公司或許已解決重大數學難題：黎曼猜想</summary></entry><entry><title>說唱歌手出身尼泊爾新總理首訪印度：如何平衡對華關係</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64gn9jl5lveo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T00:09:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64gn9jl5lveo/trad--6ddb573c32e0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64gn9jl5lveo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">說唱歌手出身的尼泊爾新總理沙哈首訪印度，盼重啟關係並爭取山洪重建援助，但邊界爭議與經驗不足成考驗</summary></entry><entry><title>中美俄元首峰會：從烏克蘭、伊朗、和平宣言到承諾核對話</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c38x04eppnpdo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T12:22:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c38x04eppnpdo/trad--998083d65242.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c38x04eppnpdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">會後發表的中俄美元首和平宣言顯示，三國領導人承諾就「減少核風險、防止核擴散」展開對話，並就聯合國改革、能源穩定和國際刑事法院管轄權等議題達成四點共識。</summary></entry><entry><title>「台灣乾爹」光環崩塌：黃仁勳事件如何震動產業、政治與社會？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T09:51:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad--d4f113586173.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmn80j39wq06o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">黃仁勳光速跌落神壇的事件，讓台灣社會對他的崇拜、政治對他的政績綁定，以及產業對他個人的依賴重新校準。</summary></entry><entry><title>緬甸種族滅絕裁決影響深遠的歷史意義</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5n4eylmmg8po/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T08:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5n4eylmmg8po/trad--c5b0031236ad.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5n4eylmmg8po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC國際編輯寫道，律師將研究岡比亞如何證明緬甸意圖實施種族滅絕。</summary></entry><entry><title>從倉頡換成漢語拼音：電腦輸入法會影響下一代學習中文嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxq6e216p7ylo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T06:12:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxq6e216p7ylo/trad--737603724a9b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cxq6e216p7ylo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">香港教育局提出小學二年級學生應該初步掌握以「漢語拼音輸入法」在電腦上輸入中文。打字方式的改變，會如何影響下一代學習語言？</summary></entry><entry><title>里長赴中旅遊受關注：為何北京鎖定里長？里長怎麼看？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-16T09:03:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad--590a4fb67825.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3elx8gxdn3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣地方選舉即將到來，近年北京對台統戰工作重心從政商菁英轉向基層社會，而里長作為選舉期間的地方「樁腳」，就成為了北京的重要接觸對象。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國人如何背棄特朗普——2026中期大選結果覆盤</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f#6</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T00:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f--393d86e5dbaa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/resources/idt-eb5702ee-a7ac-4445-8942-456df0e95f0f?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">九張圖表解釋民主黨在美國中期選舉中的壓倒性勝利，以及這對總統意味著甚麼。</summary></entry><entry><title>九合一前夕：台灣幾乎年年選舉，會引起「投票疲勞」嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T10:39:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad--7bd3a1bacef6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63egjkzqpz2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣在過去七年間，幾乎每年都有大型選舉、罷免或公投。有學者形容台灣政治人物常處於「選舉模式」，在面對不同議題時往往急於回應。</summary></entry><entry><title>從蔡康永、《VIVANT》到姆巴佩，北京為何區別處理「辱華」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-06T00:21:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad--c99d6f3ad72f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6gm0rdzm0rdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">最近幾週，中國輿論場接連出現多宗被貼上「辱華」標籤的爭議事件：台灣藝人蔡康永、日本電視劇《VIVANT》以及法國球星姆巴佩。三宗事件看似性質相近，但官方反應與輿論熱度卻明顯不同，多位分析人士對BBC中文指出：這些差異背後是當局對於每個事件的定性並不相同。</summary></entry><entry><title>你的孩子會說謊嗎？這或許並非壞事</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg2lyq7dxvo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T00:10:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg2lyq7dxvo/trad--2be70a328ee8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crvg2lyq7dxvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">父母可能會因為孩子撒謊而生氣，但專家解釋說，這是孩子人格成長的過程</summary></entry><entry><title>胰臟癌治療現突破，新藥試驗顯示部分患者腫瘤消失</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vg2vv10kjdo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-23T11:23:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vg2vv10kjdo/trad--b4aed8873d74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vg2vv10kjdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一款新藥在臨床試驗中顯示可縮小腫瘤，甚至可能令小部分胰臟癌患者體內腫瘤完全消失，但仍需要更長期的臨床試驗。</summary></entry><entry><title>羅伯·派汀森：《暮光之城》男主角如何成為007</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T02:38:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad--03fa8a167e7c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c893rgw9zrxqo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">羅伯·派汀森（Robert Pattinson）早已在《暮光之城》系列、《蝙蝠俠》和《奧德賽》等電影，奠定了自己作為男主角、動作明星及演員的地位。如今，他接下詹姆士·龐德（James Bond；占士邦）一角，將使他的知名度更上一層樓。</summary></entry><entry><title>身體最常受傷、卻很少人會刻意鍛鍊的部位：腳踝</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T00:29:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad--c5f5a8d6cf18.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwj05r347d0lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">運動物理治療師珍妮薇芙·陶亞（Genevieve Tawiah）分享了她護理關節的秘訣；關節問題佔急診就診量的 5%。</summary></entry><entry><title>「你甚至不會告訴密友」：分娩後遺症，為何多年後仍揮之不去？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-26T08:38:13Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T08:33:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad--b1eb3b049467.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwr7grvx00yxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從失禁到長期疼痛，數以百萬計的女性在分娩數十年後仍然飽受後遺症困擾。</summary></entry></feed>
